{"id": "EUVD-2026-81745", "enisaUuid": "b3ccddb3-90d8-3027-a12e-f1a865878133", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nsmb/server: fix session leak in ksmbd_session_register()\n\nSee the procedure below:\n\n  smb2_sess_setup\n    ksmbd_smb2_session_create\n      __session_create\n        atomic_set(&sess->refcnt, 2)\n        hash_add(sessions_table, &sess->hlist, sess->id)\n    ksmbd_session_register\n      xa_store(&conn->sessions, sess->id, sess) // fail\n    ksmbd_user_session_put\n      atomic_dec(&sess->refcnt) // refcnt is 1, session is not freed\n\nRemove the session from sessions_table and drop its table reference if\nxa_store() fails.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T16:06:45", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:50:08", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/988f99bfddda4e2d1da5f6e98b237dd85e123cee", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/03a22a003f41b182245e6c71fe565e277cff7094", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b967a595fb735d313a8676b2ca6a4cba38506482", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/55c677619084f9c9fa4146d933cc8ccafc924c87", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/99b25b046e47e4904373cfeb445c5483f1633d88"], "aliases": ["GHSA-c2gf-579m-pqr2", "CVE-2026-90152"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "24e3d4e5-af17-31bf-bf0f-356b7bffdd7b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f5c779b7ddbda30866cf2a27c63e34158f858c73 <b967a595fb735d313a8676b2ca6a4cba38506482"}, {"id": "35c9d608-2d55-3e56-a0f3-f3063db5a72f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f5c779b7ddbda30866cf2a27c63e34158f858c73 <99b25b046e47e4904373cfeb445c5483f1633d88"}, {"id": "4dbf0151-29dd-3d03-9dbb-4e69b1062d5a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d270631c21e68fb8016d6e231d022d7023a2df6f"}, {"id": "64ec1d78-a685-3670-8ef9-f3ebf8280871", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}},